        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/p/ba8739/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2013-10-27T23:17:16.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>There are quite a few cards which have \"would\" with only an implied \"instead\". I think that the police backup is clearly one of them, and you destroy them instead of discarding.</p>",
