        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/phantaskippy/{size}/1897_2.png",
        "created_at": "2013-10-28T15:21:09.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>If you discarded for it Police backup would be destroyed, because the discard was the effect (optional or not) of the villain card.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>We can petition Arenson to put the question of whether the discard is prevented by police backup in the questions list, but I'm pretty certain it does not prevent it.</p>",
