      {
        "id": 78248,
        "name": "Foote",
        "username": "Foote",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/foote/{size}/1877_2.png",
        "created_at": "2013-10-28T16:02:32.000Z",
        "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote group-playtesters\" data-username=\"TheJayMann\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/thejaymann/48/2261_2.png\" class=\"avatar\"> TheJayMann:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>Maybe someone with enough time should go through every card that has a 'would' trigger which does not have an explicit 'instead' or 'also' or a clearly implied 'also' and post them up, so that it can be determined for certain which ones are 'also' and which are 'instead.'</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>Speaking of \"would\" triggers, the rumor is that Christopher has a clarification to the Fortitude/Super Human Durability ruling. Thats what the Essen folks have told me. Maybe we will get a better sense of what \"would\" actually means when Christopher decides to drop in and finally put that issue to rest.</p>",
